BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 134.50 Td (NOT B: Unbounded sensitivity would strongly oppose the persistent rise.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 120.90 Td (NOT C: Sensory fibres do not become motor fibres.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 107.30 Td (NOT D: Resetting does not require loss of every afferent signal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7 Tf 47 93.70 Td (SOURCE: circulation-2:Q44; 18, 24-27) Tj ET
