BT /F1 9 Tf 47 731.00 Td (WHY: More stretch -> faster baroreceptor firing -> more input to the NTS. The NTS excites the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 47 717.50 Td (depressor area \(which inhibits the pressor area\) and the vagal neurons, so sympathetic output) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 47 704.00 Td (falls and vagal output rises.) Tj ET
