BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 674.90 Td (NOT C: The reflex suppresses rather than increases sympathetic pressor drive.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 661.30 Td (NOT D: Increased wall stretch increases, rather than decreases, afferent traffic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7 Tf 47 647.70 Td (SOURCE: circulation-2:Q40; 22-24) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 47 623.70 Td (37. D - Venoconstriction shifts stored blood centrally.) Tj ET
