BT /F1 9 Tf 47 482.40 Td (does not necessarily cause necrosis.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 466.90 Td (NOT B: Infarction can occur across a range of heart rates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 453.30 Td (NOT C: Transient angina ordinarily reflects reversible myocardial ischaemia.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 439.70 Td (NOT D: Stable angina may result from fixed stenosis without rupture.) Tj ET
